msgstr "*mode*"

#: ../../library/pyb.CAN.rst:219 ../../library/pyb.CAN.rst:240
msgid "Contents of *params*"
msgstr "*params* 內容"

#: ../../library/pyb.CAN.rst:220 ../../library/pyb.CAN.rst:260
msgid "``CAN.LIST16``"
msgstr "``CAN.LIST16``"

#: ../../library/pyb.CAN.rst:221
msgid "Four 16-bit IDs that will be accepted."
msgstr "四個將被接受的 16 位元 ID。"

#: ../../library/pyb.CAN.rst:222 ../../library/pyb.CAN.rst:263
msgid "``CAN.LIST32``"
msgstr "``CAN.LIST32``"

#: ../../library/pyb.CAN.rst:223
msgid "Two 32-bit IDs that will be accepted."
msgstr "兩個將被接受的 32 位元 ID。"

#: ../../library/pyb.CAN.rst:224 ../../library/pyb.CAN.rst:266
msgid "``CAN.MASK16``"
msgstr "``CAN.MASK16``"

#: ../../library/pyb.CAN.rst:225
msgid ""
"Two 16-bit id/mask pairs, e.g. ``(1, 3, 4, 4)``. The first pair (``1, 3``) "
"accepts all IDs with bit 0 = 1 and bit 1 = 0; the second pair (``4, 4``) "
"accepts all IDs with bit 2 = 1."
msgstr ""
"兩組 16 位元 id/遮罩配對，例如 ``(1, 3, 4, 4)``\\ 。第一組（\\ ``1, 3``\\ ）接受所有 bit 0 = 1 且 "
"bit 1 = 0 的 ID；第二組（\\ ``4, 4``\\ ）接受所有 bit 2 = 1 的 ID。"

#: ../../library/pyb.CAN.rst:228 ../../library/pyb.CAN.rst:269
msgid "``CAN.MASK32``"
msgstr "``CAN.MASK32``"

#: ../../library/pyb.CAN.rst:229
msgid "One 32-bit id/mask pair (otherwise the same as ``CAN.MASK16``)."
msgstr "一組 32 位元 id/遮罩配對（其餘與 ``CAN.MASK16`` 相同）。"

#: ../../library/pyb.CAN.rst:232
msgid ""
"Contents of *params* array for **CAN FD** controllers (OpenMV Cam H7 / H7 "
"Plus / Pure Thermal):"
msgstr ""
"**CAN FD** 控制器（OpenMV Cam H7 / H7 Plus / Pure Thermal）的 *params* 陣列內容："

#: ../../library/pyb.CAN.rst:241
msgid "``CAN.RANGE``"
msgstr "``CAN.RANGE``"

#: ../../library/pyb.CAN.rst:242
msgid "Two IDs forming a range of accepted IDs."
msgstr "兩個構成所接受 ID 範圍的 ID。"

#: ../../library/pyb.CAN.rst:243
msgid "``CAN.DUAL``"
msgstr "``CAN.DUAL``"

#: ../../library/pyb.CAN.rst:244
msgid "Two IDs that will be accepted (e.g. ``(1, 2)``)."
msgstr "兩個將被接受的 ID（例如 ``(1, 2)``\\ ）。"

#: ../../library/pyb.CAN.rst:245
msgid "``CAN.MASK``"
msgstr "``CAN.MASK``"

#: ../../library/pyb.CAN.rst:246
msgid "One ``(id, mask)`` pair (e.g. ``(0x111, 0x7FF)``)."
msgstr "一組 ``(id, mask)`` 配對（例如 ``(0x111, 0x7FF)``\\ ）。"

#: ../../library/pyb.CAN.rst:248
msgid ""
"*rtr* For classic CAN controllers, this is an array of booleans that states "
"whether a filter should accept a remote transmission request message. If "
"this argument is not given it defaults to ``False`` for all entries. The "
"length depends on *mode*:"
msgstr ""
"*rtr* 對傳統 CAN 控制器而言，這是一個布林值陣列，用於指定濾波器是否應接受遠端傳輸要求（remote transmission "
"request）訊息。若未提供此引數，則所有項目預設為 ``False``\\ 。其長度取決於 *mode*\\ ："

#: ../../library/pyb.CAN.rst:258
msgid "``len(rtr)``"
msgstr "``len(rtr)``"

#: ../../library/pyb.CAN.rst:261
msgid "4"
msgstr "4"

#: ../../library/pyb.CAN.rst:264 ../../library/pyb.CAN.rst:267
msgid "2"
msgstr "2"

#: ../../library/pyb.CAN.rst:270
msgid "1"
msgstr "1"

#: ../../library/pyb.CAN.rst:273
msgid "For CAN FD this argument is ignored."
msgstr "對 CAN FD 而言，此引數會被忽略。"

#: ../../library/pyb.CAN.rst:275
msgid ""
"*extframe* If True the frame will have an extended identifier (29 bits), "
"otherwise a standard identifier (11 bits) is used."
msgstr "*extframe* 若為 True，影格將使用延伸識別碼（29 位元），否則使用標準識別碼（11 位元）。"

#: ../../library/pyb.CAN.rst:281
msgid "Clear and disables a filter bank:"
msgstr "清除並停用一個濾波器組："

#: ../../library/pyb.CAN.rst:283
msgid ""
"*bank* is the classic CAN controller filter bank, or CAN FD filter index, to"
" clear."
msgstr "*bank* 是要清除的傳統 CAN 控制器濾波器組，或 CAN FD 濾波器索引。"

#: ../../library/pyb.CAN.rst:284
msgid ""
"*extframe* For CAN FD controllers, if True, clear an extended filter "
"(configured with extframe=True), otherwise the clear a standard identifier "
"(configured with extframe=False)."
msgstr ""
"*extframe* 對 CAN FD 控制器而言，若為 True，則清除延伸濾波器（以 extframe=True 設定者），否則清除標準識別碼（以 "
"extframe=False 設定者）。"

#: ../../library/pyb.CAN.rst:289
msgid "Return ``True`` if any message waiting on the FIFO, else ``False``."
msgstr "若 FIFO 上有任何訊息正在等待，則回傳 ``True``\\ ，否則回傳 ``False``\\ 。"

#: ../../library/pyb.CAN.rst:293
msgid "Receive data on the bus:"
msgstr "在匯流排上接收資料："

#: ../../library/pyb.CAN.rst:295
msgid "*fifo* is an integer, which is the FIFO to receive on"
msgstr "*fifo* 是一個整數，表示要接收的 FIFO"

#: ../../library/pyb.CAN.rst:296
msgid "*list* is an optional list object to be used as the return value"
msgstr "*list* 是一個選用的 list 物件，用作回傳值"

#: ../../library/pyb.CAN.rst:297
msgid "*timeout* is the timeout in milliseconds to wait for the receive."
msgstr "*timeout* 是等待接收的逾時時間，以毫秒為單位。"

#: ../../library/pyb.CAN.rst:299
msgid "Return value: A list containing five values."
msgstr "回傳值：包含五個值的 list。"

#: ../../library/pyb.CAN.rst:301
msgid "The id of the message."
msgstr "訊息的 id。"

#: ../../library/pyb.CAN.rst:302
msgid "A boolean that indicates if the message ID is standard or extended."
msgstr "一個布林值，指示訊息 ID 為標準或延伸。"

#: ../../library/pyb.CAN.rst:303
msgid "A boolean that indicates if the message is an RTR message."
msgstr "一個布林值，指示訊息是否為 RTR 訊息。"

#: ../../library/pyb.CAN.rst:304
msgid "The FMI (Filter Match Index) value."
msgstr "FMI（Filter Match Index，濾波器比對索引）值。"

#: ../../library/pyb.CAN.rst:305
msgid "An array containing the data."
msgstr "包含資料的陣列。"

#: ../../library/pyb.CAN.rst:307
msgid ""
"If *list* is ``None`` then a new list will be allocated, as well as a new "
"bytes object to contain the data (as the fifth element in the list)."
msgstr ""
"若 *list* 為 ``None``\\ ，則會配置一個新的 list，並配置一個新的 bytes 物件來容納資料（作為 list 中的第五個元素）。"

#: ../../library/pyb.CAN.rst:310
msgid ""
"If *list* is not ``None`` then it should be a list object with a least five "
"elements.  The fifth element should be a memoryview object which is created "
"from either a bytearray or an array of type 'B' or 'b', and this array must "
"have enough room for at least 8 bytes.  The list object will then be "
"populated with the first four return values above, and the memoryview object"
" will be resized inplace to the size of the data and filled in with that "
"data. The same list and memoryview objects can be reused in subsequent calls"
" to this method, providing a way of receiving data without using the heap. "
"For example::"
msgstr ""
"若 *list* 不為 ``None``\\ ，則它應為一個至少有五個元素的 list 物件。第五個元素應為一個 memoryview 物件，由 "
"bytearray 或型別為 'B' 或 'b' 的 array 所建立，且此陣列必須有足夠空間容納至少 8 個位元組。接著，list "
"物件將被填入上述前四個回傳值，而 memoryview 物件會就地調整大小至資料大小並填入該資料。同一個 list 與 memoryview "
"物件可在後續呼叫此方法時重複使用，提供一種不使用堆積（heap）即可接收資料的方式。例如：："

#: ../../library/pyb.CAN.rst:327
msgid "Send a message on the bus:"
msgstr "在匯流排上傳送一則訊息："

#: ../../library/pyb.CAN.rst:329
msgid "*data* is the data to send (an integer to send, or a buffer object)."
msgstr "*data* 是要傳送的資料（要傳送的整數，或一個 buffer 物件）。"

#: ../../library/pyb.CAN.rst:330
msgid "*id* is the id of the message to be sent."
msgstr "*id* 是要傳送之訊息的 id。"

#: ../../library/pyb.CAN.rst:331
msgid "*timeout* is the timeout in milliseconds to wait for the send."
msgstr "*timeout* 是等待傳送的逾時時間，以毫秒為單位。"

#: ../../library/pyb.CAN.rst:332
msgid ""
"*rtr* is a boolean that specifies if the message shall be sent as a remote "
"transmission request.  If *rtr* is True then only the length of *data* is "
"used to fill in the DLC slot of the frame; the actual bytes in *data* are "
"unused."
msgstr ""
"*rtr* 是一個布林值，指定是否應將訊息作為遠端傳輸要求傳送。若 *rtr* 為 True，則僅使用 *data* 的長度來填入影格的 DLC "
"欄位；\\ *data* 中的實際位元組則不會被使用。"

#: ../../library/pyb.CAN.rst:336
msgid ""
"*extframe* if True the frame will have an extended identifier (29 bits), "
"otherwise a standard identifier (11 bits) is used."
msgstr "*extframe* 若為 True，影格將使用延伸識別碼（29 位元），否則使用標準識別碼（11 位元）。"

#: ../../library/pyb.CAN.rst:338
msgid ""
"*fdf* for CAN FD controllers, if set to True, the frame will have an FD "
"frame format, which supports data payloads up to 64 bytes."
msgstr "*fdf* 對 CAN FD 控制器而言，若設為 True，影格將採用 FD 影格格式，可支援最多 64 位元組的資料負載。"

#: ../../library/pyb.CAN.rst:340
msgid ""
"*brs* for CAN FD controllers, if set to True, the bitrate switching mode is "
"enabled, in which the data phase is transmitted at a different bitrate. See "
":meth:`CAN.init` for the data bit timing configuration parameters."
msgstr ""
"*brs* 對 CAN FD 控制器而言，若設為 True，則啟用位元率切換模式，在此模式下資料階段會以不同的位元率傳輸。資料位元時序的設定參數請參閱 "
":meth:`CAN.init`\\ 。"

#: ../../library/pyb.CAN.rst:344
msgid ""
"If timeout is 0 the message is placed in a buffer in one of three hardware "
"buffers and the method returns immediately. If all three buffers are in use "
"an exception is thrown. If timeout is not 0, the method waits until the "
"message is transmitted. If the message can't be transmitted within the "
"specified time an exception is thrown."
msgstr ""
"若 timeout 為 0，訊息會被放入三個硬體緩衝區之一，方法隨即立刻回傳。若三個緩衝區都正在使用中，則會擲出例外。若 timeout 不為 "
"0，則方法會等待直到訊息傳送完成。若訊息無法在指定時間內傳送，則會擲出例外。"

#: ../../library/pyb.CAN.rst:350
msgid "Return value: ``None``."
msgstr "回傳值：\\ ``None``\\ 。"

#: ../../library/pyb.CAN.rst:354
msgid ""
"Register a function to be called when a message is accepted into an empty "
"FIFO:"
msgstr "註冊一個函式，當訊息被接受並進入一個空的 FIFO 時呼叫該函式："

#: ../../library/pyb.CAN.rst:356
msgid "*fifo* is the receiving FIFO."
msgstr "*fifo* 是接收的 FIFO。"

#: ../../library/pyb.CAN.rst:357
msgid "*fun* is the function to be called when the FIFO becomes non-empty."
msgstr "*fun* 是當 FIFO 變為非空時要呼叫的函式。"

#: ../../library/pyb.CAN.rst:359
msgid ""
"The callback function takes two arguments: the first is the CAN object "
"itself; the second is an integer that indicates the reason for the callback:"
msgstr "此回呼函式接受兩個引數：第一個是 CAN 物件本身；第二個是一個整數，指示觸發回呼的原因："

#: ../../library/pyb.CAN.rst:367
msgid "Reason"
msgstr "原因"

#: ../../library/pyb.CAN.rst:368
msgid "Meaning"
msgstr "意義"

#: ../../library/pyb.CAN.rst:369
msgid "``0``"
msgstr "``0``"

#: ../../library/pyb.CAN.rst:370
msgid "A message has been accepted into an empty FIFO."
msgstr "一則訊息已被接受並進入一個空的 FIFO。"

#: ../../library/pyb.CAN.rst:371
msgid "``1``"
msgstr "``1``"

#: ../../library/pyb.CAN.rst:372
msgid "The FIFO is full."
msgstr "FIFO 已滿。"

#: ../../library/pyb.CAN.rst:373
msgid "``2``"
msgstr "``2``"

#: ../../library/pyb.CAN.rst:374
msgid "A message has been lost due to a full FIFO."
msgstr "因 FIFO 已滿而遺失一則訊息。"

#: ../../library/pyb.CAN.rst:376
msgid "Example use of rxcallback::"
msgstr "rxcallback 的使用範例：："

#: ../../library/pyb.CAN.rst:391
msgid "Constants"
msgstr "常數"

#: ../../library/pyb.CAN.rst:393
msgid "Bus-mode constants (``mode`` argument of :meth:`init`):"
msgstr "匯流排模式常數（\\ :meth:`init` 的 ``mode`` 引數）："

#: ../../library/pyb.CAN.rst:398
msgid ""
"The controller participates normally on the bus -- transmits its own frames "
"and acknowledges valid received frames."
msgstr "控制器正常參與匯流排活動 —— 傳送自己的影格並對有效的接收影格進行確認（ACK）。"

#: ../../library/pyb.CAN.rst:404
msgid ""
"Internal loopback mode: the controller is disconnected from the pins and "
"routes transmitted frames straight back to the receive path. Useful for "
"self-tests without a transceiver."
msgstr "內部迴路測試模式：控制器與接腳斷開，並將傳送的影格直接繞回接收路徑。適用於無需收發器的自我測試。"

#: ../../library/pyb.CAN.rst:411
msgid ""
"Listen-only mode: the controller receives frames but never drives the bus "
"(no ACK, no transmissions). Useful for bus sniffing."
msgstr "僅聆聽模式：控制器接收影格，但永不驅動匯流排（不發送 ACK、不傳送）。適用於匯流排監聽。"

#: ../../library/pyb.CAN.rst:417
msgid ""
"Combines :data:`SILENT` and :data:`LOOPBACK`: no pin activity and no "
"acknowledgements, with internal loopback of TX into RX."
msgstr "結合 :data:`SILENT` 與 :data:`LOOPBACK`\\ ：無接腳活動、無確認，並將 TX 內部繞回 RX。"

#: ../../library/pyb.CAN.rst:420
msgid "Controller-state constants (returned by :meth:`state`):"
msgstr "控制器狀態常數（由 :meth:`state` 回傳）："

#: ../../library/pyb.CAN.rst:425
msgid "The controller is completely off and reset."
msgstr "控制器完全關閉並已重設。"

#: ../../library/pyb.CAN.rst:430
msgid ""
"The controller is on and in the Error Active state (both TEC and REC are "
"less than 96)."
msgstr "控制器開啟且處於錯誤主動（Error Active）狀態（TEC 與 REC 均小於 96）。"

#: ../../library/pyb.CAN.rst:436
msgid ""
"The controller is on and in the Error Warning state (at least one of TEC or "
"REC is 96 or greater)."
msgstr "控制器開啟且處於錯誤警告（Error Warning）狀態（TEC 或 REC 至少一者為 96 或以上）。"

#: ../../library/pyb.CAN.rst:442
msgid ""
"The controller is on and in the Error Passive state (at least one of TEC or "
"REC is 128 or greater)."
msgstr "控制器開啟且處於錯誤被動（Error Passive）狀態（TEC 或 REC 至少一者為 128 或以上）。"

#: ../../library/pyb.CAN.rst:448
msgid ""
"The controller is on but not participating in bus activity (TEC overflowed "
"beyond 255)."
msgstr "控制器開啟但不參與匯流排活動（TEC 溢位超過 255）。"

#: ../../library/pyb.CAN.rst:451
msgid ""
"Classic-CAN filter modes (``mode`` argument of :meth:`setfilter` on the "
"OpenMV Cam M4 / M7):"
msgstr "傳統 CAN 濾波器模式（OpenMV Cam M4 / M7 上 :meth:`setfilter` 的 ``mode`` 引數）："

#: ../../library/pyb.CAN.rst:457
msgid ""
"The filter ``params`` array holds four 16-bit IDs that will be accepted."
msgstr "濾波器的 ``params`` 陣列存放四個將被接受的 16 位元 ID。"

#: ../../library/pyb.CAN.rst:463
msgid ""
"The filter ``params`` array holds two 32-bit IDs that will be accepted."
msgstr "濾波器的 ``params`` 陣列存放兩個將被接受的 32 位元 ID。"

#: ../../library/pyb.CAN.rst:469
msgid "The filter ``params`` array holds two 16-bit ``(id, mask)`` pairs."
msgstr "濾波器的 ``params`` 陣列存放兩組 16 位元 ``(id, mask)`` 配對。"

#: ../../library/pyb.CAN.rst:474
msgid "The filter ``params`` array holds one 32-bit ``(id, mask)`` pair."
msgstr "濾波器的 ``params`` 陣列存放一組 32 位元 ``(id, mask)`` 配對。"

#: ../../library/pyb.CAN.rst:476
msgid ""
"CAN FD filter modes (``mode`` argument of :meth:`setfilter` on the OpenMV "
"Cam H7 / H7 Plus / Pure Thermal):"
msgstr ""
"CAN FD 濾波器模式（OpenMV Cam H7 / H7 Plus / Pure Thermal 上 :meth:`setfilter` 的 "
"``mode`` 引數）："

#: ../../library/pyb.CAN.rst:482
msgid ""
"The filter ``params`` array holds two IDs forming a range of accepted IDs."
msgstr "濾波器的 ``params`` 陣列存放兩個構成所接受 ID 範圍的 ID。"

#: ../../library/pyb.CAN.rst:488
msgid "The filter ``params`` array holds two specific IDs to accept."
msgstr "濾波器的 ``params`` 陣列存放兩個要接受的特定 ID。"

#: ../../library/pyb.CAN.rst:493
msgid "The filter ``params`` array holds one ``(id, mask)`` pair."
msgstr "濾波器的 ``params`` 陣列存放一組 ``(id, mask)`` 配對。"
